MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_001: Woe! Woe! Why has it come to this? What am I\nto do?
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_002: *gasp* Promised One! You have happened upon me\nin a moment of terrible disarray.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_003: You see, Kalla shared the most distressing news.\nI can hardly bring myself to believe it.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_004: <NCA>"Please, share it with me."
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_005: Alright—it's... She intends to step down from\nher temple!
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_006: She will stay in her position only until the war\nis won and peace returns to the world.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_007: After that, she'll no longer need tending to by her\npriests. Won't even tell us where she's going!
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_008: This is the goddess of the arts we're talking about,\nwho nurtures beauty and is beloved by all.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_009: Imagine the epidemic of joylessness that will ensue if\nshe vanishes!
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_010: Oh, I know! You can speak with her, yes? Encourage\nKalla to reconsider?
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_011: Surely, if the Promised One of all people spoke to\nher, she would rethink her decision.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_012: I know. It's her choice. And she will not be\nswayed easily.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_013: But how can I say goodbye to the god I owe so\nmuch? Who took me in after I ran away from home...
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_014: Who perfected my singing and dancing through her\nguidance. Who, as strict as she was, was always kind.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_015: I cannot even express the joy I felt when she\nnamed me the Blue Rose of Caelus.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_016: For a young noble who had renounced her status,\nwhat higher honor could there be?
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_017: <NCA>"It's just a title."
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_018: <NCB>"There are other honors you could get."
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_019: <ACA>*gasp* Promised One or no, I will not brook\nsuch disrespect!
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_020: <ACB>Are there? Well, certainly none that carry the\nsame weight.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_021: To bloom, a beauty such as I requires the vivifying\nlight of praise and the dewy drizzle of recognition!
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_022: <NCA>"Do flowers need titles?"
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_023: <NCB>"A flower without a title would be just as beautiful."
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_024: <ACA>Yes! I only earned others' adoration because of\nmy title. Before that, everyone— Well. Except Kalla.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_025: <ACB>Pardon? That's not... Hm.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_026: I suppose it's possible I was mistaken.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_027: <NCA>"You'll find your answer."
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_028: <NCB>"Kalla and I both believe in you."
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_029: Promised One. Ah...
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_A_030: I will strive to meet your expectations.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_001: ♪The herald of purest light...manifests garbed\nin white...♪
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_002: ♪By this kind heart, we're led on...through the night\nto a new dawn...♪
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_003: Back, Promised One? Certainly took your time.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_004: I'm afraid if you were hoping to hear me sing,\nyou're a little late.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_005: <NCA>"Sorry about that."
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_006: <NCB>"What was that song?"
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_007: <ACA>Oh, I kid. I wrote that song for you—I'll treat you to\nit whenever you like.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_008: <ACB>A composition of mine! And one that I'm quite\nproud of. I wrote it for you.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_009: But Promised One, if you'll allow it, I have something\nmore important to share with you.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_010: Ever since we spoke that day, I have been\nconsidering my view on titles.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_011: Considering what truly matters...and what it means\nto be a flower in bloom.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_012: Kalla's choice to honor me became central to how I\nperceived myself.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_013: I believed that the Blue Rose of Caelus was the title\nthat suited me best...
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_014: and that my life would be well lived as long as I did\nall I could to be worthy of it.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_015: But flowers grow. And being given a title is not the\nsame as growing.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_016: It seems so simple now that I say it, but I'd become\nsingle-minded, I suppose.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_017: Disrespectful as it feels to do so...I have relinquished\nthe title of Blue Rose of Caelus.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_018: Kalla said nothing when I told her, but the\nsatisfaction was evident in her smile.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_019: Now, I shall flourish and blossom by simply,\nwell...living.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_020: After all, what need have I of a title? I was given one\nwhen I came into the world.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_021: <NCA>"Olympia."
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_022: Indeed. And may it ring out far and wide!
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_023: <RSDS>I am Olympia, a flower ever blooming, unmatched in\nkindness and beauty.
MID_SE_Ism_Oly_S_024: And you, Promised One, must not for one moment\nlook away from my radiance.